Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.71,0:00:14.91,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,470)\fs170\fad(120,250)\fscx60\fscy60\t(0,220,\fscx100\fscy100)\1c&H008B3DFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}15 FORMAS
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.96,0:00:14.91,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,615)\fad(150,250)}de ficar rico
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.50,0:00:41.10,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00D6E62E\shad6\4c&H40240612}GUIA VICE CITY
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.70,0:00:41.10,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}guia novo toda semana às 17h
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:51.41,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Número quinze: a lojinha de conveniência.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.43,0:00:53.74,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A Rockstar mostrou isso logo no primeiro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.76,0:00:56.17,Legenda,,0,0,0,,trailer: Jason e Lucia entrando de máscara
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.19,0:00:56.87,Legenda,,0,0,0,,numa loja.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.89,0:00:59.70,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E sim, dá pra fazer isso desde o capítulo um.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:00.80,Legenda,,0,0,0,,O problema: paga pouco.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:01.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Fica na casa das centenas por loja.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.98,0:01:04.60,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Então pensa assim: lojinha não é pra ficar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:07.06,Legenda,,0,0,0,,rico, é pra pagar a gasolina do começo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:09.66,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Minha dica: escolhe lojas longe do centro, na
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:10.74,Legenda,,0,0,0,,beira da estrada.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.76,0:01:12.66,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A polícia demora mais pra chegar, e você sai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:14.14,Legenda,,0,0,0,,com duas estrelas, não com cinco.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:17.27,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E um detalhe que pouca gente usa: com a Lucia
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:20.47,Legenda,,0,0,0,,junto, um rende o caixa enquanto o outro vigia
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.49,0:01:21.19,Legenda,,0,0,0,,a porta.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:23.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Sai mais rápido, e mais rápido é menos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:23.93,Legenda,,0,0,0,,polícia.
